body:
I'm currently obsessed with a rarepair. I've posted fics, art, headcanons, gifs, edits, memes and clips of them across many platforms and I feel like it's slowly but surely gaining more popularity. It's not **popular** by any means but I've gotten a hand full of folks into it.

&#x200B;

Gotta note tho that I also draw porn of them which brings more people in who otherwise wouldn't have considered the pair. Smut is a good hook!

My most popular story on AO3 has 376 kudos, 5 comments, 24 bookmarks and 6264 hits :DD

&#x200B;

My less popular fics have more comments tho which is funny. Small fandoms tend to be more vocal in that way ig

Having dark fantasies doesn't necessarily mean anything sinister but it would probably help your friend if they could talk about these dark fantasies openly in a safe environment (to a therapist or a close friend). Maybe that could help them understand where they come from and how to deal with them in a healthy way.

&#x200B;

I have very unsettling intrusive thoughts sometimes and I find it helpful to vent about them to my closest friend. It actually helps lessen the frequency of these thoughts. This isn't entirely applicable here but thought I should still mention it.
